{"ref":"BDB, עָשַׁן","hw":"עָשַׁן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עָשַׁן</span></big>  <strong>vb. denom. smoke, be wroth</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong> <strong>1.</strong> <strong>a.</strong>  <em>smoke,</em> Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳</span> of mt. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 19:18\" href=\"/Exodus.19.18\">Ex 19:18</a>, so Impf. 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">יֶעֱשָׁ֑נוּ</span> (at touch of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:32\" href=\"/Psalms.104.32\">ψ 104:32</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 144:5\" href=\"/Psalms.144.5\">144:5</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  fig., 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יֶעְשַׁן אַף־י׳</span>, c. ב <em>against</em>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 29:19\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.29.19\">Dt 29:19</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 74:1\" href=\"/Psalms.74.1\">ψ 74:1</a>. Hence <strong>2.</strong>  subj. pers., <em>fume</em>, i.e. <em>be wroth,</em> Pf. 2 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">עָשַׁנְתָּ בּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 80:5\" href=\"/Psalms.80.5\">ψ 80:5</a>.","next":"BDB, עָשֵׁן","prev":"BDB, עָשָׁן"}